                                                "example_id": "f648d326-b4bc-4fe1-a2ca-335cd941486b",
                                                "sense_id": "88b14ff8-617b-3390-a883-b5070ea29557",
                                                "text": "The report Shaping the Future also gives a set of learning outcomes for those people candidating for ordained ministry. These were also agreed by the Methodist Conference."
